Package: meshtastic-mui
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends}
Suggests: meshtasticd
Description: Meshtastic UI (MUI) client for X11
 Meshtastic is an off-grid text communication platform that uses inexpensive
 LoRa radios.
 .
 MUI is a standalone graphical client that connects to a Meshtastic node
 over TCP/IP (e.g. a local or remote meshtasticd) or a USB serial port.
 .
 This package contains the X11 build.

Package: meshtastic-mui-fb
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends}
Suggests: meshtasticd
Description: Meshtastic UI (MUI) client for the Linux framebuffer
 Meshtastic is an off-grid text communication platform that uses inexpensive
 LoRa radios.
 .
 MUI is a standalone graphical client that connects to a Meshtastic node
 over TCP/IP (e.g. a local or remote meshtasticd) or a USB serial port.
 .
 This package contains the framebuffer/evdev build, which renders directly
 to /dev/fb* without an X server.
